      "message": "Right. min_sdk_verison doesn\u0027t always need to be sdk_version. Also, we want to use the Java model for native modules. Please see [1]. \n\n[1] https://docs.google.com/document/d/14Y9Vfrh2XuQTns8fLbL9PdRDz0sHOs6Ieflijiqvebo/edit?usp\u003dsharing",
